OL,3,GNEWSAYouth disorder sparks urgent call
OL,4,Afor action
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice need to take urgent action
OL,7,Fagainst a group of young people who
OL,8,Fhave been causing havoc in part of
OL,9,FBirmingham, a councillor has said.
OL,11,FJordan Phillip, of Birmingham City
OL,12,FCouncil, said the "specific" group were
OL,13,Fresponsible for incidents of crime in
OL,14,Fthe Kings Heath area, including High
OL,15,FStreet and Kings Heath Park.
OL,17,FThe Green Party member said the
OL,18,Fincidents included vandalising homes or
OL,19,Fbusinesses, using knives to threaten
OL,20,Flocals and "intimidating behaviour"
OL,21,Ftowards people attending evening
OL,22,Fclasses at the All Saints Centre.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
